{
  "name": "JobHunter — E-mail versturen",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "jobhunter-send-email",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6bc3705a-8ae5-46ce-a46e-2c72f2683d53",
      "name": "Webhook: send email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "3dcd3d61-c2b9-4934-95de-28f81b818277"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.body.to.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.body.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.body.body }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "senderName": "={{ $json.body.from?.name || '' }}",
          "replyTo": "={{ $json.body.replyTo?.email || '' }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "729adf5c-ec8d-4175-81ee-e69024230add",
      "name": "Gmail: send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, messageId: $('Webhook: send email').first().json.body.messageId }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "c505ee11-26a8-45eb-883d-d7f35941fbef",
      "name": "Respond: sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: String((typeof $json.error === 'string' ? $json.error : $json.error?.message) || 'send failed').slice(0, 300) }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 500
        }
      },
      "id": "d78e2881-aa70-4f7d-a7ff-8dc96cfae5f0",
      "name": "Respond: failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invullen na importeren\n1. **Webhook: send email** → Header Auth-credential *JobHunter → n8n* (`x-jobhunter-secret` = `N8N_SECRET`)\n2. **Gmail: send** → Gmail OAuth2-credential (inloggen met het afzendaccount)\n3. Workflow publiceren (**Publish**; in n8n-versies vóór 2.0 heet dit **Active**); de **Production URL** van de webhook in `N8N_SEND_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_URL` zetten.\n\nAntwoordt pas na het versturen: 200 = verstuurd, 500 = mislukt (de app zet de mail dan op failed).",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "ae0a40c3-86e2-4b0b-a705-04d5ed87b127",
      "name": "Note: wat invullen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -120
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook: send email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gmail: send",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gmail: send": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond: sent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond: failed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
